Error [E-CALL-VALUE]: function values use `.call(…)`, not the retired adjacent-call form
  --> tests/ui/retired_function_value_call.jet:4:23
    |
  4 |     print(make_adder()(1))
    |                       ^
 Why: named functions use `f(…)`; a returned or stored function value uses `.call(…)` so the value and invocation stay explicit
 Fix: write `callee.call(…)`
